{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And the choicest of the land.</b> Doubled, \"the land of the plain.\"" "<b>and its fullness.</b> In that it is full." "<b>and the favor of the dwellers in the bush.</b> It is the heavens." "<b>Its yield.</b> This blessing, and the two signs joined — the tav and the heh — like עזרתה, ישועתה, בצרתה. And because he mentioned תבואה, he likened the tribe to an ox and said בכור שורו, for it has great strength, for it is ראשית און."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:26:31.683513255Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}